{"c":"433026","n":"MANĚTÍNSKÝ POTOK 1","t":"P","s":"ZČ","o":"Manětín","url":"433026-manetinsky-potok-1-xpk1w","stav":"2026-10-04","popis":"GPS Z: 49°59'42.818\"N, 13°18'36.192\"E, K: 49°59'35.71\"N, 13°12'29.366\"E\nPřítok Střely. Od vtoku do Střely (ř. km 29,6) až k soutoku potoků Starý a Pstruhový (ř. km 8,2). Potoky Starý, Pstruhový a ostatní přítoky do Manětínského potoka jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. V úseku od starého mostu u kostela sv. Barbory v Manětíně k jezu v zámeckém parku v Manětíně je chráněná rybí oblast – lov ryb zakázán (ZčKNV, č. j. VLHZ 948/87).","delka":14,"rozloha":4,"lat":49.992925,"lon":13.259106,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/manetin","mo_tel":"727912378","mo_mail":"crsmanetin@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Losos